# Repository topology & packages

> **Code is SSOT** — 结构漂移时与代码同 PR 改本文件。分层矩阵 → [`code-layers.mdc`](code-layers.mdc)。

## Packages

| Package | Path | Role |
| ------- | ---- | ---- |
| `freeanima` | 仓库根 | Habitat + CLI + capabilities + features + shells（根 `package.json` + `bun.lock`） |
| `@freeanima/site` | `site/` | Astro/Starlight（workspace；共用根 lock） |

## Import prefixes（RFC #1）

| Shape | Pattern | Example |
| ----- | ------- | ------- |
| Host layer | `@freeanima/host/{layer}` | `host/kernel` … `host/platform` |
| Capability | `@freeanima/host/capabilities/{slug}` | `self`, `memory`, `tools`, `outpost` |
| Feature | `@freeanima/features/{slug}/…` | `features/chat/…` |
| Shared | `@freeanima/shared/{name}` | `habitat-rpc`, `rpc-contract` |
| UI kit | `@freeanima/ui-kit` | 设计系统（∥ shared） |
| Client | `@freeanima/client/{portal-sdk,app-frame}` | Portal chrome |
| Entry | `src/portal/{cli,app,extension}` | CLI / Shell / MV3 |

**Deprecated**：`@freeanima/frontend/*`、`@freeanima/runtime`、`@freeanima/capabilities/identity`、`@freeanima/capabilities/remote-tools`、裸 `@freeanima/platform`、`@freeanima/core`。

## `src/` map

```
src/
├── host/{kernel,core,engine,capabilities,platform}
├── client/{portal-sdk,app-frame}
├── ui-kit/          # 仅 client 消费者；无协议
├── features/<slug>/ # ui + domain + habitat + protocol + plugin
├── shared/          # 无 React
└── portal/{app/{tauri,web},extension,cli}
```

MCP 形态入口在 `host/capabilities/mcp-server`（不在 `portal/`）。Habitat 管理台 = 普通 `features/habitat`。

## Module resolution

- TS：`tsconfig.base.json` paths `@freeanima/*` → `src/*`
- Vite：`src/client/app-frame/vite/` 别名对齐 paths

## 护栏

- oxlint `freeanima/import-depth` / `layer-deps` / `dir-import-exists`
- 文档站：`cd site && bun run build`（先根 `bun install`）
